    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes shooting. Pick 1 **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit of yours that lost at least 1 model to those attacks.\n\nIt may move up to D6\", but must finish as near as it can to the nearest enemy unit (ignoring **AIRCRAFT**). During this move, its models are allowed inside that enemy unit's [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range).",
